# sbmerlin — infrastructure of the VPN provider itself: panel, subscription,
# node hostnames and their CDNs.
#
# These must always go DIRECT. Routing them through the proxy makes the tunnel
# depend on itself: when a node dies, the client can no longer reach the panel
# or refresh its subscription to recover, and the router keeps retrying through
# a dead path.
#
# One domain per line; subdomains are matched automatically.
fire-core.ru
core-fire.ru
tele-forge.ru
boykisser.online
boy-kisser.ru
femboy.house
spmam.ru
